    "prompt": "You are analyzing daily assets under management (AUM) for different portfolios managed by a robo advisor. Write a query that calculates the 7-day rolling average AUM for each portfolio. The rolling average should include the current day and the 6 preceding days. For days where fewer than 7 days of history exist, compute the average using only the available days. Return portfolio_id, snapshot_date, daily_aum, and rolling_avg_aum_7d (rounded to 2 decimal places). Order results by portfolio_id ascending, then snapshot_date ascending.",
